<CENTER> Unity News </CENTER><FONT color="white" SIZE=2>Todays date is: <FONT color="white" SIZE=3>8/28/99<FONT color="white"><BR><BR> Geryon/Straoth/Skall added on 7/18/99:  Guild is Disbanded, Prepare for no more Guild Chat<BR><HR><BR><BR>  Geryon added on 5/25/99: Another Reminder. All members will be contacted in the game. Try to be on between 8-10PM EST the next two days. I will need everyones help to secure this Site. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>   Kalath and Geryon added on 5/25/99: The new format is up. If the left link doesn't work, that means it hasn't been finished yet. Only general forums and news is setup currently. How do you like it? It took a lot of work. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>    Geryon added on 5/24/99: Please send me an email with ur Info. Its important once we lock this site up. Im trying to work with Kalath to get this to be a useful site with all sorts of things on it, but before we lock it I would appreciate the name/pw<br> 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>     Kalath added on 5/22/99: We are beginning to implement the house system. Nominate three people who you believe will be competant house leaders. The voting will begin later on. These three do NOT include Kalath, Teal, Geryon. So nominate now. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>      Geryon added on 5/19/99: Hope you like our new Logo. Spent 2 Hrs perfecting it yesterday. Expect much more to come to the web page soon. Also I would like you to email your name and a password (Not the one from Everquest) to Equnity@aol.com. We will begin a members section forums and PW protect it as soon as this web page becomes better. Planning to include Quests, Items and Guides as well as stronger guild information. Stick around because its going to get a lot better. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>       Teal added on 5/16/99: Thanks for everyone who attended the Guild Meeting on Saturday.  I think we accomplished some important things.  We are currently moving into a "House" based ranking system based on yesterday's meeting.  If anyone has any complaints or additions they want to see or discuss, please write them in the forums.  Thank you. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>        Geryon/Skall/Straoth added on 5/13/99: For those of you visiting this site, please read the message I have left. Its a serious one concerning me and Everquest. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>         Teal added on 5/12/99: Guild Meeting on Saturday, 8 PM Eastern Time, VERY important meeting.  All guild members please try to attend.  Thank you. 
<BR><HR><BR><BR>         Teal added on 5/10/99: War with KoT, they are to be Killed on Sight without question.  They will learn NOT to mess with the Unity. 
<BR><HR>
